    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaka na Abimeleki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, yīkagwa nzala hangī ū mu sī yenīyo, kūleka ī nzala ya mu shikū ja ng'wa Abulahamu. Ū Isaka ūja Geela kūlī Abimeleki, ntemi wa Bafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wilongela ū Isaka ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ūtizūja Misili, ikalaga mu sī īyo nalīkūwīla kwikala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalaga ū mu sī yenīyī ikanza ho, nakūbiza hamò nang'ho; na nakūkūfuuha. Nguno pyī ī sī jenīji nakūkwinha, jibize wingīji wako hamò na shibyalīlwe shako; na nakūgūshikīlīgīja ū mhayo ūyo nang'wilahīlīla so Abulahamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Shibyalīlwe shako nakūshīta shibize na banhū bingī gītī sonda ja ng'wigūlū. Nīyo nakūbinha pyī ī sī jenīji, hama pye a mahanga ga mu sī gakwanukūla mu nzīla ya būbyīle wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Abulahamu walī aniigwile, washimīzīlaga mu katongeelele kane; na a malange gane walī agadimile, pye na a kahelele nī shilagīlo shane.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Isaka wikala Geela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū ba kwene ūlū bamūja ī mihayo ya nke wakwe, wabawīlaga gīkī, “Ilūmbū lyane,” nguno oogohaga ū kūhaya gīkī, “Nke wane.” Wiganikaga, “A banhū ba kūūnū bakūnibūlaga kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Lebbeka, nguno nsoga no ī lihanga lyakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isaka aho wikala ī lipandī lyenīlo shikū ningī, lūshikū lūmò ū Abimeleki walī mu kaya yakwe walolaga kūbītīla ng'widilisha, ūmona ū Isaka alīhooya nū Lebbeka na kwigusha nang'hwe mu būtogwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Abimeleki ūng'witana ū Isaka ūng'wīla gīkī, “Bebe angū gashi nke wako ū nkīma ng'wenūyo! Hama nibūlī ūkūhayaga gīkī, ‘Ilūmbū lyane?’” Ū Isaka ūshosha, “Nakogohaga gīkī natizūbūlagwa kūlwa nguno yakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Abimeleki ūng'wīla, “Mhayo kī ū gwenūyū watwītīlile? Nguno ngosha ose ose ū mu bise ūmu walī ashikile kūshihya nū nke wako, ūtwingīja mu makoye a bise!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū Abimeleki ūbahūgūla pye a banhū alībawīla gīkī, “Ose ose ūyo ūgima kūng'wītīla ya būbi ū munhū ng'wenūyū, nūūlū ū nke wakwe; tambala shilanga akūbūlagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'waka gwenūyo ū Isaka aho walīma, ī shilīwa īsho akahamba shikaponeka no, nguno ū SEEBA walī amfuuhile no no no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo ongeja ū kūsaba, kūshisha ūbiza nsabi ntaale no; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūja madaale ga mitugo, na a ha kaya ūkwīja no a batūmami; kūshisha nose a Bafilisti būng'wītīla wilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzwinzī ījo jalī jasīmva na batūmami ba ng'wa ise mu shikū ja ng'wa ise Abulahamu, a Bafilisti būjikandīīla, būjichiba pyī ī jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ū Abimeleki ūng'wīla ū Isaka gīkī, “Bebe ī gete saamaga ūtwīngīle ū ng'wenūmu, nguno watūkīlīīlile no!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'hana ū Isaka ūsaama aho wikalaga, ūja kwikala mu sī ya ntubīlo, mumo Geela ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzwinzī ījo jalī jasīmva mu shikū ja ng'wa ise Abulahamu, ījo Bafilisti bakajikandīīla aho wazumalīka ū ise ū Abulahamu, ū Isaka ūjifukūūla hangī; ūjinha na a mina ayo walī wajinha ū ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batūmami ba ng'wa Isaka bakasīmba lwinzī ū mu sī ya ntubīlo yenīyo, būpandīka lwa nzwīlo ja minzī ga kūyūpumunhīka dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a badīīmi ba mu Geela būbikoloosha a badīīmi ba ng'wa Isaka; būbayoja balībawīla gīkī, “A minzī genaya gise.” Na lūūlū ū lwinzī lwenūlo, ū Isaka ūlwilīka lina lya Eseki,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Eseki:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū makūlū gaho Yombo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nguno bakamūūkīja yombo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būsīmba lūngī, alīyo biza na a ha lwenūlo kūbayoja; ū lwene ūlwitana Sitina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Sitina:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, Wilwisha.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūsegeja wīnga a h'ipandī lyenīlo, ūūkasīmba lūngī; lelo atigelile munhū wa kūbikoloosha a ha lwenūlo. Ū lwene ūlwitana Lehoboti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lehoboti:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, Ng'wanya; nūūlū Kūgalīhīlwa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ūhaya gīkī, “Ī haha lūūlū ū SEEBA watwinha ng'wanya gwa kwigalīhīja, na kūkwīla mu sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo akīnga na a henaho, ūsaamīla Beeli-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu būjikū wa lūshikū lwenūlo ū SEEBA ūng'wilongela; ūng'wīla gīkī, “Ū nene nalī Mulungu wa ng'wa so Abulahamu; yaya ū kogoha nguno nalī hamò nang'ho. Nakūkūfuuha, na a banhū ba shibyalīlwe shako nakūbongeja bakwīle no no no, kūlwa nguno ya ntūmami wane Abulahamu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isaka ūbeeja ng'walīlo a henaho; ūlīkumīlīja ī lina lya ng'wa SEEBA; ūtūūla ho na ng'hambī yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'hambī yakwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, iheema lyakwe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " A batūmami bakwe būsīmba lwinzī ho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū Abimeleki wiza kūfuma Geela; walī na Ahuzati ngunanhi wakwe mu būsugi, na Pikoli ūyo walī ntaale wa bashilikale bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isaka ūmūja gīkī, “Ni ginehe ng'wanikūūbīja, tūhaya mukanikolwa ng'ūnipeeja nūng'wīngīla?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja balīhaya, “Twabonile hape gīkī ū SEEBA alī hamò nang'ho, na lūūlū tūhaya gīkī, ‘Shiigelile twiyilahīlīle.’ Hū kūhaya twizunīlīje a ha gatī yise nū bebe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī ūtūtwītīla mhayo gose gose gwabūbi, gīt'umo na a bise tūtakūkoyije mu mhayo gose gose. Alīyo pye a makanza ayo walī hamò nise twakūgunanhaga chiza, nose lyūshika ikanza lyako lya kūtwīngīla, wīnga mu mhola dūhū. Al'ī haha angū ūūyū ūlī na ja ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isaka ūbabeegeja shigukulu, būlya na kūng'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha ntondo yaho a bose bizunīlīja mu kwilahīla, hūna ū Isaka ūbafunya kūbashindīkīla, bīnga būja mu mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū lūshikū lwenūlo, a batūmami bakwe ū Isaka būng'wenhela mhola ja lwinzī bakasīmba; būng'wīla, “Twapandīkaga minzī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Isaka ūlwitana ū lwinzī lwenūlo, Shiba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:33",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Īdūgije kūbiza na makūlū ga, kūlahīla Nūūlū, mpungatī. Hū kūhaya lūlī lwinzī lwa haho bakiyilahīgīgīja, Nūūlū, lwa mpungatī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kūshisha na lelo īyī ī lina lya nzengo gwenūyo līmanīkile Beeli-sheba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
